_prompts.py, _extract.py and _label.py contain selected unchanged definitions.
Only imports, decorators and surrounding framework code have been omitted.
Source paths, selected definition names and SHA256 hashes are in upstream.json.

G-Pass@k and mG-Pass@k are implemented independently using exact integer
combinations, following the hypergeometric definitions in GPassK at commit
20a02a1479c2db19d9b8a8676c809c4696f9e889. No GPassK source is bundled.

